      "raw": "<p>Basically, we like to refer to Savage Mana as Haka shoving things in his pants. He just picks them up and crams them down in there. It&#39;s great when he does, like, space ships... La Capitan&#39;s boat... A live dragon (potentially twice! Zhu Long, meet other Zhu Long!) Somehow the joke came up that Pinkie Pie got caught up in there too, and decided to throw a party. A pants party. Because *shrug*. One hilarious interaction we found was that you could fight Baron Blade atop his mobile defense platform. Well, as you are no doubt well aware, in order to take on Blade, you need to bring down the MDP Target that exists within his villain deck. Doing so with Haka will cause him to stuff the MDP in his pants. While the rest of the fight is still taking place. INSIDE THAT VERY SAME MDP. So now everyone exists inside the MDP which is inside Haka&#39;s pants, which themselves are physically located inside the MDP. Looking outside results in a very Doctor Strange, kaleidoscope​-like recursion of themselves and the MDP, reflecting and refracting info infinity. Naturally, thanks to Spacetime itself being utterly destroyed, Pinkie is there again (running gags!) and decides to throw another party. A Haka&#39;s Pants Recursively Broke Spacetime Party. Then she looks up. &quot;Oh, and someone already brought disco balls!&quot;</p>",
