      "id": 199665,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-06-28T21:44:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Amazing. XD I will have to share this story with my friends.</p><p>We tend to consider Savage Mana as Haka \"eating\" things. And then puking them back out.</p><p>Which led to a funny scenario where he'd eaten a whole bunch of the Matriarch's birds. Haka goes to use Savage Mana's power for a bit hit against Matriarch, which I described this way:</p><p>Imagine the battle field. Haka has been rampaging around, stuffing whole birds in his mouth for some time now. Then, all of a sudden, he walks up to the Matriarch. She's ready to fight him, but he's rather green around the gills. She's like, Are you okay? To which he answers, in a pained voice, \"Four and twenty blackbirds\" then vomits a stream of birds back into her face.</p><p>I dunno, it was funny at the time.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:27:48.133Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
